    'about_title': 'VibesBox – Your Direct Link to the DJ',
    'about_subtitle': 'Your request matters! With VibesBox you send your favorite songs straight to the DJ\'s display – no crowding at the deck or paperwork. Send greetings with your song and enjoy the party. Have fun!',
